# Future remote adapter configuration only. Current demo mode reads no env values.
# Copy to .env.local only while implementing and validating a remote adapter.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=replace_with_public_frontend_key
# VITE_ values are public in the browser. Never place a secret/service-role key,
# database password, or administrator credential here or anywhere in src/.
